#: ../../04_building-apps/sdk/02_java.md:6
msgid "`io.decentralchain:java-sdk` is the SDK for Java and other JVM languages. It connects to a node's REST API, creates keys and addresses, and builds and signs every transaction type offline. It is developed in [`packages/jvm/java-sdk`](https://github.com/Decentral-America/DecentralChain/tree/main/packages/jvm/java-sdk) of the DecentralChain monorepo under the MIT license, and published to Maven Central."
msgstr ""

#: ../../04_building-apps/sdk/02_java.md:9
msgid "Verified on 2026-10-25 against release 2.0.2, the latest on Maven Central (`repo1.maven.org/maven2/io/decentralchain/java-sdk/maven-metadata.xml`). The samples compile with JDK 25, and the account and Testnet samples ran against the public Testnet node. The transfer sample has not been broadcast as part of this documentation pass."
msgstr ""

#: ../../04_building-apps/sdk/02_java.md:12
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "الاحتياجات"

#: ../../04_building-apps/sdk/02_java.md:14
msgid "The SDK requires **Java 25** or later. The 2.0.x jars are compiled for Java 25 (class file version 69), so an older JVM fails with `UnsupportedClassVersionError`. The package README still says Java 11; that applies to older releases only."
